linux-x86_64 native seed, built from source immediately preceding the commit
that ships this file. It is the preferred fast stage zero on Linux/x86-64 and
links libLLVM 21.

source: src/compiler/main.coil (LLVM + x64)
proof:  forced-WASM stage0 + byte-identical stage2/stage3 fixed point + Linux
        IR/runtime, lint, property, WASM-build, CLI, target-OS, Scheme, compiler
        stage, and corpus-coverage gates.

The seed embeds the standard library present at build time. Refresh it with
scripts/compiler/refresh-seed.sh after compiler-language or compiler-used stdlib
changes. If it is absent or stale, bootstrap automatically falls back to the
portable WASM seed.
